<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CST -USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CST -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cow and bull carcasses not established, USDA said.</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>COW &amp; BULL CARCASS CAF WEST COAST  Nil Loads reported.</p>
<p>	     Lds     Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
