<p>BONELESS PROCESSING BEEF/BEEF TRIMMINGS  69.0  Loads Reported. Lean boneless beef steady to 3.00 lower; 85% 2.50-5.00 lower; 65% generally steady. Demand light for light to moderate offerings.</p>
<p>Beef trimmings firm on light to moderate demand and offerings.</p>
